// test-only: a Rat that plays the mod's NEW sound group AudioProbe_New (audio/combat_sfx.gon.merge, file
// audio/combat_sfx/audioprobe_new.wav from this mod) through the vanilla LoopingSoundWhileAlive passive.
AudioProbeRat {
